:: Start
You wake up in a small room. A door stands to the north.

[[Open the door->North Hall]]
[[Look around->Look]]

:: North Hall
You step through the door into a long hallway.

[[Go back->Start]]

:: Look
The room is bare except for the bed you were sleeping on.

[[Return->Start]]
